@quotation
@strong{@anchor{Exercise 5.21}Exercise 5.21:} Implement register machines for
the following procedures.  Assume that the list-structure memory operations are
available as machine primitives.

@enumerate a

@item
Recursive @code{countLeaves} over the typed memory words:

@example kotlin
context(r: Raise<GuestError>)
fun countLeaves(tree: GValue, memory: Memory): Long =
    if (tree is GValue.VNull) 0L
    else if (isPair(tree))
        countLeaves(memory.car(tree),
            memory) + countLeaves(memory.cdr(tree),
                memory)
    else 1L
@end example

@item
Recursive @code{countLeaves} with an explicit counter:

@example kotlin
context(r: Raise<GuestError>)
fun countLeavesIter(tree: GValue,
    memory: Memory,
    n: Long): Long =
    if (tree is GValue.VNull) n
    else if (!isPair(tree)) n + 1L
    else countLeavesIter(
        memory.cdr(tree),
        memory,
        countLeavesIter(memory.car(tree), memory, n),
    )
@end example
@end enumerate
@end quotation

